@startuml Activity_Monitor_Real_Time_Sensor_Data
title Activity Diagram: Monitor Real-Time Sensor Data (UC-009)

|User|
start
:Navigate to "Monitoring Dashboard";

|System|
:Display farm selection dropdown;

|User|
:Select farm from dropdown;

|System|
:Query InfluxDB for latest sensor readings;

if (Sensor data available?) then (yes)
  :Retrieve current sensor values\n(soil moisture, pH, temp, humidity, light);
  :Calculate status for each sensor\n(compare against thresholds);

  fork
    :Display soil moisture reading;
  fork again
    :Display pH reading;
  fork again
    :Display temperature reading;
  fork again
    :Display humidity reading;
  fork again
    :Display light level reading;
  end fork

  :Show color-coded status indicators\n(green=optimal, yellow=warning, red=critical);
  :Display "Last Updated" timestamp\nfor each sensor;

  if (Any critical thresholds exceeded?) then (yes)
    :Highlight sensors in red\nwith warning icon;
    :Show alert message\n(e.g., "Soil moisture critically low");
    :Display recommended action;

    |User|
    if (Create task for action?) then (yes)
      |System|
      :Create task\n(e.g., "Water plants");
      :Save task to database;
    else (no)
      :User acknowledges alert;
    endif
  else (no)
    :All sensors within normal range;
  endif

  |User|
  if (View detailed trend chart?) then (yes)
    :Click on specific sensor;

    |System|
    if (Sufficient historical data?) then (yes)
      :Query InfluxDB for\nlast 24 hours data;
      :Render historical trend chart;
      :Display chart to user;
    else (no)
      :Display message\n"Collecting data... Charts\navailable after 1 hour";
    endif
  else (no)
    :Continue viewing dashboard;
  endif

  if (Check another sensor?) then (yes)
    |System|
    :Return to dashboard view;
  else (no)
  endif

  if (Check other farms?) then (yes)
    |User|
    :Select different farm;
    |System|
    -[#blue]-> Retrieve current sensor values;
  else (no)
  endif

else (no)
  if (Sensor offline (no data >1 hour)?) then (yes)
    :Show "Offline" indicator in red;
    :Display last known value\nwith timestamp;

    |User|
    if (Troubleshoot sensor?) then (yes)
      |System|
      :Display connectivity diagnostics;
      :Show sensor configuration;
      :Provide troubleshooting tips;
    else (no)
      :User exits;
    endif
  else (no data at all)
    :Display "No data" message;
    :Prompt user to register sensors;

    |User|
    if (Register sensors now?) then (yes)
      |System|
      :Navigate to sensor registration;
    else (no)
      :User exits;
    endif
  endif
endif

|User|
:Exit dashboard or\ncheck other features;
stop

note right
  **Key Decision Points:**
  1. Data availability check
  2. Threshold violation detection
  3. User action creation
  4. Historical data availability
  5. Multi-farm monitoring

  **Auto-Update:**
  Dashboard auto-refreshes
  every 60 seconds
end note

@enduml
